1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,271
Fourteen ships entered the

2
00:00:01,291 --> 00:00:03,439
Suez Canal for a one-day trip.

3
00:00:03,560 --> 00:00:05,420
They got out eight years later.

4
00:00:05,440 --> 00:00:07,420
Halfway through, war broke out.

5
00:00:07,440 --> 00:00:09,539
Egypt sank ships to block the canal.

6
00:00:09,680 --> 00:00:11,750
Trapped in a lake, nowhere to go.

7
00:00:11,770 --> 00:00:13,696
Sandstorms dusted them yellow.

8
00:00:13,750 --> 00:00:14,803
The Yellow Fleet.

9
00:00:14,890 --> 00:00:16,345
Their countries were rivals.

10
00:00:16,410 --> 00:00:18,040
The sailors became friends.

11
00:00:18,060 --> 00:00:19,135
Football on deck.

12
00:00:19,170 --> 00:00:20,202
Their own stamps.

13
00:00:20,330 --> 00:00:21,620
Their own Olympics.

14
00:00:21,640 --> 00:00:22,449
Poland won.

15
00:00:22,475 --> 00:00:23,685
Home to Hamburg.

16
00:00:23,705 --> 00:00:25,507
Tens of thousands cheered.

17
00:00:25,585 --> 00:00:26,615
Part of the cargo?

18
00:00:26,635 --> 00:00:27,525
Kitchen clocks.

19
00:00:27,545 --> 00:00:29,505
Delivered only eight years late.

20
00:00:29,575 --> 00:00:31,515
How many stars for this delivery?
